# 🧭 A deployment-shaped Pingclairfile: one site, files from disk.
#
# 📌 This is the name `pingclair run` looks for in a working directory. The
# syntax is the Caddyfile's; `examples/README.md` explains the corpus around it.
{
	metrics
}

http://static.example.test:8080 {
	root * ./public

	@assets path /assets/*
	header @assets Cache-Control "public, max-age=3600"

	file_server
}
